// Charge counters ([CR#122.1] counters in general; e.g. [CR#721.2a]'s
// station threshold reads "N or more charge counters on it"): a MARKER
// counter with no conferred bearing of its own — every card effect that cares
// reads its count directly (`CounterCount(This, ChargeCounter)`) or spends it
// via an activated ability's own cost/effect. Like `AgeCounter`/
// `LoyaltyCounter`, it confers no `Continuous`/`StateBased` property.
CounterKind(
    name: "ChargeCounter",
    params: [],
    spelling: "charge",
    grammar: FixedTerm(surface: "charge"),
    body: Counter(name: "ChargeCounter"),
)
